    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάσασθαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>division of spoil,</i>
			
